uality of life again.</p>\n<p>This makes you wonder:</p>\n<p>How much of an aging brain is actually gone and how much is waiting... to be switched back on.</p>\n<p>One month later, she took a follow-up dose of 3 grams and improved even more...</p>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" href=\"https://www.frontiersin.org/journals/neuroscience/articles/10.3389/fnins.2026.1813281/full\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.frontiersin.org/journals/neuroscience/articles/10.3389/fnins.2026.1813281/full</a></p>\n", "score_down": 0, "author_flair_text": "", "pro_tier": 0, "is_stickied": false, "is_nsfw": false, "is_deleted": false, "is_image": false, "comments": 13, "score_up": 77, "is_edited": false, "is_moderator": false, "awards": 0, "vote_state": 2, "link_metadata": {"status": 200}, "post_flair_text": "", "archive_id": ""}, {"is_locked": false, "tweet_id": "", "sticky_comment": 0, "is_video_mp4": false, "type": "link", "uuid": "1ATC9SA5x4", "is_twitter": false, "is_admin": false, "score": 19, "suggested_sort": 0, "post_flair_class": "", "id": 8767682, "raw_content": "", "author": "necrosexy", "created": 1786075006555, "profile_picture": "", "community": "TheDonald", "ad_tier": 2, "last_comment_author": "covfefe77", "is_video": false, "video_link": "", "is_new_user": false, "domain": "www.nbcnews.com", "is_crosspost": false, "preview": "", "removal_source": "", "link": "https://www.nbcnews.com/health/health-news/fda-approves-1st-mrna-flu-shot-moderna-rcna590599", "author_flair_class": "", "is_removed": false, "media": {"resized_resolutions": [], "blurhash": "", "full_resolution": []}, "title": "Prosecute Fauci while implementing the pernicious medical procedures that he's introduced", "last_comment_created": 1786076163585, "content": "", "score_down": 0, "author_flair_text": "", "pro_tier": 0, "is_stickied": false, "is_nsfw": false, "is_deleted": false, "is_image": false, "comments": 2, "score_up": 19, "is_edited": false, "is_moderator": false, "awards": 0, "vote_state": 2, "link_metadata": 